      "sceneId": "arcade",
      "cueAtMs": 13667,
      "maxDurationMs": 6400,
      "deliveryPromptZh": "纸条离湖后进入夜间拱廊，旁白低沉、稳定、客观，只说明移动结果，不朗读任务，不制造惊悚腔。",
      "subtitleZh": "湖面没有留下它。夜风把它送进了仍然亮着灯的教学楼。",
      "voiceTextEn": "The lake did not keep it. The night wind carried it into the teaching building that was still lit.",
      "subtitleSurface": "scene",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "pitch": -4
    },
    {
      "key": "ch4_prologue_cleaner_01",
      "speaker": "cleaner",
      "voiceRole": "female_cleaner",
      "sceneId": "lobby",
      "cueAtMs": 29450,
      "maxDurationMs": 3600,
      "deliveryPromptZh": "大厅保洁员推车经过湿地面时随口提醒，声音近、友善、自然；先提醒地滑，再用一句短话指出纸条往楼内去了，不停下讲解。",
      "subtitleZh": "小心，刚拖过。那张纸往里去了。",
      "voiceTextEn": "Careful, I just mopped. That paper went inside.",
      "subtitleSurface": "scene",
      "speed": 1.08,
      "pitch": 0,
      "emotion": "calm",
      "normalizationProfile": "short_dialogue_consistent_v2"
    },
    {
